<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar to tender for 30,000T U.S. soy, corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar to tender for 30,000T U.S. soy, corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp will tender on Wednesday for a combined shipment of 18,000 tonnes of No.2 or better grade U.S. yellow corn and 12,000 tonnes of No.2 or better U.S. yellow soybeans, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The maximum moisture limits for the shipment are 14.5 percent for the corn and 13.5 percent for the soybeans.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p> Soybean	12,000	 U.S. Gulf	Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> Corn	   18,000	 Nov 1-15	 Nov 15-30</p>
<p>--Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
